{"id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category.md","title":"Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴","display":"Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category","aliases":["14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category"],"display":"Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴","depends_on":["[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(S_0,F,R,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{out})\">\\(S=(S_0,F,R,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{out})\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在拓扑斯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中的结构，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a>。对这些结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 遍历下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{M,N}\">\\(H_{M,N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec s\\in S_0^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec s\\in S_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^\\Pi_{\\vec s}\">\\(h^\\Pi_{\\vec s}\\)</span> 使用同项的有限积、投影与 Pair；空序列给出所选终对象的唯一自箭头。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的几何理论，模型对象条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a>。构造模型范畴时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P\">\\(M,N,P\\)</span> 遍历其模型对象集合；模型态射编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,N,h)\">\\((M,N,h)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,k\">\\(h,k\\)</span> 为底层分量族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsModelHom}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsModelHom}\\)</span> 对任意同签名结构解释。子对象类采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a>；子对象逆像和次序采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{M,N}:=\\prod_{s\\in S_0}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M_s,N_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{M,N}:=\\prod_{s\\in S_0}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M_s,N_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^{\\Pi}_{(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}:=\\operatorname{Pair}_{N_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}\\bigl((h_{s_i}\\circ\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i})_{i=1}^n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^{\\Pi}_{(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}:=\\operatorname{Pair}_{N_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}\\bigl((h_{s_i}\\circ\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i})_{i=1}^n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall f\\in F\\ h_{\\operatorname{out}(f)}\\circ M_f=N_f\\circ h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall r\\in R\\ M_r\\le(h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(r)})^{-1}(N_r)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall f\\in F\\ h_{\\operatorname{out}(f)}\\circ M_f=N_f\\circ h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall r\\in R\\ M_r\\le(h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(r)})^{-1}(N_r)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf O:=\\operatorname{Models}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad\\mathsf A:=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid M,N\\in\\mathsf O\\land h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf O:=\\operatorname{Models}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad\\mathsf A:=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid M,N\\in\\mathsf O\\land h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E):=\\bigl(\\mathsf O,\\mathsf A,((M,N,h)\\mapsto M),((M,N,h)\\mapsto N),(M\\mapsto(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0})),(((N,P,k),(M,N,h))\\mapsto(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E):=\\bigl(\\mathsf O,\\mathsf A,((M,N,h)\\mapsto M),((M,N,h)\\mapsto N),(M\\mapsto(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0})),(((N,P,k),(M,N,h))\\mapsto(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))=\\mathsf O,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))=\\mathsf O,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M,N,P\\in\\mathsf O\\ \\forall(M,N,h)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)\\ \\forall(N,P,k)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(N,P)\\quad(N,P,k)\\circ(M,N,h)=(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M,N,P\\in\\mathsf O\\ \\forall(M,N,h)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)\\ \\forall(N,P,k)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(N,P)\\quad(N,P,k)\\circ(M,N,h)=(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M\\in\\mathsf O\\quad1_M=(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M\\in\\mathsf O\\quad1_M=(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 X.2–3 的同态保持函数运算并将关系送入关系；不要求反射关系。复合保持这些方程和包含，故给出模型范畴。源靶标签不可省略：相同载体上的不同关系结构可能允许同一恒等分量族作为不同模型对之间的同态；三元组编码排除箭头源靶冲突。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a> 只定义 Models 对象集合，避免与本项的范畴构造构成数学循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","