分量族作为不同模型对之间的同态；三元组编码排除箭头源靶冲突。[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 只定义 Models 对象集合，避免与本项的范畴构造构成数学循环。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S=(S_0,F,R,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{out})","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"H_{M,N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec s\\in S_0^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"h^\\Pi_{\\vec s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,P","display":false},{"tex":"(M,N,h)","display":false},{"tex":"h,k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsModelHom}","display":false},{"tex":"H_{M,N}:=\\prod_{s\\in S_0}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M_s,N_s).","display":true},{"tex":"h^{\\Pi}_{(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}:=\\operatorname{Pair}_{N_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}\\bigl((h_{s_i}\\circ\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i})_{i=1}^n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall f\\in F\\ h_{\\operatorname{out}(f)}\\circ M_f=N_f\\circ h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall r\\in R\\ M_r\\le(h^{\\Pi}_{\\operatorname{ar}(r)})^{-1}(N_r)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf O:=\\operatorname{Models}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad\\mathsf A:=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid M,N\\in\\mathsf O\\land h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E):=\\bigl(\\mathsf O,\\mathsf A,((M,N,h)\\mapsto M),((M,N,h)\\mapsto N),(M\\mapsto(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0})),(((N,P,k),(M,N,h))\\mapsto(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))=\\mathsf O,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)=\\{(M,N,h)\\mid h\\in H_{M,N}\\land\\operatorname{IsModelHom}(h,M,N)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall M,N,P\\in\\mathsf O\\ \\forall(M,N,h)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(M,N)\\ \\forall(N,P,k)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)}(N,P)\\quad(N,P,k)\\circ(M,N,h)=(M,P,(k_s\\circ h_s)_{s\\in S_0}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall M\\in\\mathsf O\\quad1_M=(M,M,(1_{M_s})_{s\\in S_0}).","display":true}],"bytes":3079,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category|Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴]]"},{"id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是固定的 $\\mathcal U$-小多类签名，$S_0$ 为其类集合；$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论。$\\mathcal B$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]。模型范畴见 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]，几何态射范畴见 [[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]，函子等价见 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]"},{"id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 是候选序列集合；$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯。模型范畴的态射、恒等和复合另见 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category|Definition — 结构同态与模型范畴]]"},{"id":"34f27739c5ea48f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$\\mathbb T$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小有穷几何理论，$\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S$；演绎与上下文条件采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]。集合模型及其有限赋值满足关系采用 [[14-df-satisfaction]]，模型范畴采用 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]。各类载体允许为空。"},{"id":"6f0a11402a38ca6b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"50ccfcdcd428a34e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"模型范畴采用 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]，量化仅遍历 $\\mathcal U$-Grothendieck 拓扑斯。"}],"outgoing":["d3923e299ec2ec5a","b51ff4f43221971d","86c3a123f8ca1262","b995af55a8b210ce"]}